---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Thank You"
  description="Your feedback has been received."
>
  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <h1>Thank You</h1>

    <p>Your feedback has been received. Responses are read and help improve this resource.</p>

    <p>If you provided an email and requested a response, you'll hear back within a few days.</p>

    <h2>What to do next</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">Return to home</a></li>
      <li><a href="/conditions/si-pain">Review the SI Pain guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/topics">Browse Topics</a></li>
      <li><a href="/search">Search for specific information</a></li>
    </ul>

    <p>If you have red flags or symptoms that worsen, see the <a href="/safety">Safety page</a> and seek medical evaluation.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
